<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Rank started as &quot;outperform&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Rank started as &quot;outperform&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rank Plc was rated &quot;outperform&quot; as Lehman Brothers began coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>In a research note analyst Fraser Ramzan said Rank's recent results showed the leisure company's commitment to delivering a better deal to shareholders, and that its aim of a 15 percent return on capital in the second full year of any investment project should help improve group returns over time.</p>
<p>The stock was down 2-1/2p at 418, in line with a decline in the market overall.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
